nued imaging for years afterward.",[407,411,414,417],{"met":46,"label":408,"note":409,"type":410},"LAUNCH","Long March 3B from Xichang 2013-12-01.","nominal",{"met":67,"label":412,"note":413,"type":410},"TLI","Direct trans-lunar injection on the LM-3B upper stage.",{"met":72,"label":415,"note":416,"type":410},"LUNAR ORBIT INSERTION","Capture into 100-km circular lunar orbit 2013-12-06.",{"met":12,"label":418,"note":419,"type":410},"LANDING","Soft landing in Mare Imbrium 2013-12-14. First soft landing since Luna 24 (1976). Yutu rover deployed hours later.","/orrery/images/missions/change3/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
